  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jordan Protection - NRC Strategic Partnership Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flyktninghjelpen/NRC in Jordan address the key obstacles faced by Syrian and non-Syrian refugees in Jordan as expressed by refugees themselves: legal barriers, economic barriers, social barriers, and barriers to accessing quality services such as education. NRC provides immediate service delivery to most vulnerable individuals, while enhancing its programmes towards improved opportunities for self-reliance and enhanced inclusion into national systems and markets. Sectors include Information, counselling and legal assistance (ICLA) and and Protection from violence. The project design is informed by a gender analysis and all indicators are disaggregated by sex.</narrative>
  </description>
